{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用快慢指针同时从头节点出发：慢指针每轮走 1 步，快指针每轮走 2 步。若链表有环，二者会在环内相遇；若快指针先遇到 null，则链表无环。动画使用示例 1 展示两指针最终在值为 -4 的节点相遇，因此返回 true，且额外列出其余示例的判断结果。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>环形链表可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .lead { margin: 0 0 8px; line-height: 1.45; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .example { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: #1c1c1c; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; font-size: 12px; }\n  .mono, .value, .index, .step-count, .complexity { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .accent { color: #3794ff; }\n  .chain { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 4px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .node { width: 38px; min-height: 48px; padding: 4px 2px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; transition: .35s; text-align: center; }\n  .node.active { border-color: #3794ff; background: #0e639c; }\n  .value { color: #d4d4d4; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .index { margin-top: 2px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .node.active .index { color: #fff; }\n  .pointers { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-height: 20px; margin-top: 4px; }\n  .pointer { display: none; padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-size: 10px; }\n  .pointer.show { display: block; }\n  .pointer.fast { color: #8fc7ff; }\n  .arrow { color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .loop-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px dashed #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .loop-arrow { color: #3794ff; font-size: 14px; }\n  .status { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; font-size: 12px; }\n  .step-count { margin-bottom: 4px; color: #3794ff; font-size: 10px; }\n  .status-text { color: #d4d4d4; font-size: 12px; }\n  .result { margin-top: 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .result strong { color: #3794ff; }\n  .rules { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .rule { padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; font-size: 12px; }\n  .rule b { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #3794ff; font-size: 13px; }\n  .examples { width: 100%; margin-top: 8px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 11px; }\n  .examples th, .examples td { padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #3c3c3c; text-align: left; }\n  .examples th { color: #8d8d8d; font-weight: 500; }\n  .yes { color: #3794ff; font-weight: 600; }\n  .no { color: #d4d4d4; font-weight: 600; }\n  .complexity { margin-top: 8px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n\n.chain .node { width: 94px; height: 110px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }\n.chain .pointers { min-height: 40px; }\n.chain .pointer { white-space: nowrap; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>快慢指针如何发现环</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">快指针每轮走两步，慢指针每轮走一步。至少移动一轮后, 若它们在同一非空节点相遇, 就能确认链表存在环. 初始同在头节点不能算相遇.</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">示例 1 · 指针移动过程</div>\n    <div class=\"example\">\n      <span>输入 <span class=\"mono accent\">head = [3, 2, 0, -4]</span></span>\n      <span><span class=\"mono accent\">pos = 1</span>，尾节点连回索引 1</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"chain\" aria-label=\"链表节点\">\n      <div class=\"node\" data-index=\"0\">\n        <div class=\"value\">3</div><div class=\"index\">索引 0</div>\n        <div class=\"pointers\"><div class=\"pointer slow\">慢指针 slow</div><div class=\"pointer fast\">快指针 fast</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"node\" data-index=\"1\">\n        <div class=\"value\">2</div><div class=\"index\">索引 1</div>\n        <div class=\"pointers\"><div class=\"pointer slow\">慢指针 slow</div><div class=\"pointer fast\">快指针 fast</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"node\" data-index=\"2\">\n        <div class=\"value\">0</div><div class=\"index\">索引 2</div>\n        <div class=\"pointers\"><div class=\"pointer slow\">慢指针 slow</div><div class=\"pointer fast\">快指针 fast</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"node\" data-index=\"3\">\n        <div class=\"value\">-4</div><div class=\"index\">索引 3</div>\n        <div class=\"pointers\"><div class=\"pointer slow\">慢指针 slow</div><div class=\"pointer fast\">快指针 fast</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"loop-row\"><span class=\"loop-arrow\">↩</span><span>索引 3 的 <span class=\"mono\">next</span> 指向索引 1，形成 <span class=\"mono accent\">2 → 0 → -4 → 2</span> 的环。</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"status\">\n      <div class=\"step-count\" id=\"stepCount\">第 0 轮</div>\n      <div class=\"status-text\" id=\"statusText\">两个指针从头节点 3 出发。</div>\n      <div class=\"result\" id=\"resultText\">尚未判断，继续移动。</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"rules\">\n    <div class=\"rule\"><b>相遇条件</b>完成本轮移动后, <span class=\"mono\">slow === fast</span> 且节点非空，说明两者进入了同一个环，返回 <span class=\"mono accent\">true</span>。</div>\n    <div class=\"rule\"><b>结束条件</b><span class=\"mono\">fast === null</span> 或 <span class=\"mono\">fast.next === null</span>，说明链表有尽头，返回 <span class=\"mono\">false</span>。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">三个示例的结论</div>\n    <table class=\"examples\">\n      <thead><tr><th>输入</th><th>快指针能否到达 null</th><th>结果</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td class=\"mono\">[3,2,0,-4], pos=1</td><td>不能，与慢指针相遇</td><td class=\"yes\">true</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"mono\">[1,2], pos=0</td><td>不能，与慢指针相遇</td><td class=\"yes\">true</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"mono\">[1], pos=-1</td><td>能，链表到达末尾</td><td class=\"no\">false</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <div class=\"complexity\">时间复杂度 O(n) · 额外空间复杂度 O(1)</div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const steps = [\n    { slow: 0, fast: 0, title: '第 0 轮', text: '两个指针从头节点 3 出发。', result: '尚未判断，继续移动。' },\n    { slow: 1, fast: 2, title: '第 1 轮', text: 'slow 走 1 步到节点 2；fast 走 2 步到节点 0。', result: '指针位置不同，继续移动。' },\n    { slow: 2, fast: 1, title: '第 2 轮', text: 'slow 到节点 0；fast 经过尾节点 -4，并沿环回到节点 2。', result: '指针位置仍不同，继续移动。' },\n    { slow: 3, fast: 3, title: '第 3 轮', text: 'slow 与 fast 同时到达节点 -4。', result: '两指针在非空节点相遇，返回 true。', done: true }\n  ];\n  const nodes = [...document.querySelectorAll('.node')];\n  const stepCount = document.getElementById('stepCount');\n  const statusText = document.getElementById('statusText');\n  const resultText = document.getElementById('resultText');\n  let current = 0;\n\n  function render(step) {\n    nodes.forEach((node, index) => {\n      const slow = node.querySelector('.slow');\n      const fast = node.querySelector('.fast');\n      const hasSlow = index === step.slow;\n      const hasFast = index === step.fast;\n      slow.classList.toggle('show', hasSlow);\n      fast.classList.toggle('show', hasFast);\n      node.classList.toggle('active', hasSlow || hasFast);\n    });\n    stepCount.textContent = step.title;\n    statusText.textContent = step.text;\n    resultText.innerHTML = step.done ? '两指针在非空节点相遇，返回 <strong>true</strong>。' : step.result;\n  }\n\n  render(steps[current]);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    current = (current + 1) % steps.length;\n    render(steps[current]);\n  }, 2200);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
